{#-
  index.njk
  =========
  Renders the wiki's index.md: the entry point an agent reads first. One line
  per entity page with its definition, then the relationships as a compact map.

  Usage:
    Engine:      Nunjucks
    Model type:  Data Model                (root variable: datamodel)
    Output file: index.md
    Output dir:  Generation/Output/llm-wiki/<data model id>
-#}
{%- import "links.njk" as wiki -%}
---
type: index
datamodel: {{ datamodel.id }}
name: "{{ datamodel.name }}"
{%- if datamodel.version %}
version: {{ datamodel.version }}
{%- endif %}
{%- for key, value in datamodel.customProperties %}
{%- if key != "$allowedValues" %}
{{ key }}: "{{ value }}"
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
entities: {{ datamodel.entities | length }}
relationships: {{ datamodel.relationships | length }}
source: crossmodel
---

# {{ datamodel.name }}

{% if datamodel.description %}{{ datamodel.description }}

{% endif -%}
Read `schema.md` first for how to use this wiki. Each entity has its own page under `entities/`.

## Entities

{% for entity in datamodel.entities -%}
- {{ wiki.entity(entity, datamodel.id) }}{% if entity.description %}: {{ entity.description }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{%- for rel in datamodel.relationships %}
{%- if loop.first %}
## Relationships

| From | Cardinality | To | Relationship |
|:-----|:-----------:|:---|:-------------|
{%- endif %}
| {{ wiki.entity(rel.parent, datamodel.id, null, true) }} | {{ rel.parentCardinality }} : {{ rel.childCardinality }} | {{ wiki.entity(rel.child, datamodel.id, null, true) }} | {{ rel.name }} |
{%- endfor %}
{%- for dep in datamodel.dependencies %}
{%- if loop.first %}

## Depends on
{% endif %}
- [[{{ dep.datamodel.id }}/index|{{ dep.datamodel.name or dep.datamodel.id }}]]{% if dep.version %} ({{ dep.version }}){% endif %}
{%- endfor %}

---
_Generated from CrossModel model `{{ datamodel.id }}`. Do not edit this page by hand: change the model and regenerate._
